      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Instead of burying it in a dense limitations section, focus your narrative on the *unique nature* of your $n=12$ cohort as a pilot or exploratory study demonstrating a novel phenomenon. Frame the findings as strong, directional evidence warranting much larger future trials, which gives the reviewers a positive path forward. Emphasize the robustness of the *effect size* observed, rather than the precision of the $p$-value derived from the small N.",
