      "content": "You can elevate the discussion by focusing on the *mechanistic insights* derived from the high-quality data you *do* possess, rather than the generalizability of the outcome. For instance, detail the biological pathways or specific neural markers you observed with unprecedented resolution in this small group. This shifts the discussion from hypothesis testing to fundamental discovery, framing the small sample as a prerequisite for deep biological characterization.",
